  "description": "A region at the southeastern coast of the Mediterranean Sea, encompassing the coastal plain between Phoenicia and Gaza. The region's name appears in Greek, derived from the Hebrew Pl\u0161th, \"the land of the Philistines\", as early as the 5th century BCE. The name is used for the region in various contemporary languages, and for associated administrative areas (like Roman provinces) throughout subsequent antiquity.",
